		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="1142965b-37a2-452d-a348-e06de28a0ef6">				
	<div class="row nest first wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last idaabd303b-2a98-4bbb-a8a0-06f1b8e23699" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="aabd303b-2a98-4bbb-a8a0-06f1b8e23699">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditorfa0b85f8-2290-4864-9c6e-4a81835aae0a" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <hr style="border:1px solid black;" aria-hidden="true" id="Resolutions"><h2 style="background-color:#284860; color:white; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px;margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em;">Ballot Resolutions Submitted by Districts</h2><p>Local ballot measures are placed on the ballot by local districts. To do this, the district must submit a resolution to the Snohomish County Auditor&apos;s Office calling for an election. The district also provides an explanatory statement and identifies people to write statements in support of and in opposition to the measure. This information is used to prepare the local voters&apos; pamphlet and place the measure on the ballot.<br><br>The full resolution does not appear on the ballot. Ballot language is developed separately and may differ from the wording used in the resolution.<br><br></p><p id="About-Ballot-Measures" style="margin-bottom:0px;"><strong>Expand the section below to see the resolutions submitted by districts for the August 4 Primary.</strong></p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + 'fa0b85f8-2290-4864-9c6e-4a81835aae0a'));
	});
</script>
</div>

	</div> <!-- inner column -->

	</div> <!-- inner row -->
	<div class="row nest last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last ida873fb1a-313a-48b8-91a5-b814a2154945" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="a873fb1a-313a-48b8-91a5-b814a2154945">	

	<div id="divTabbede1e72d47-3da3-4900-bdcd-6e03bc270ffd" class="widget widgetTabbed narrow skin105 accordionTabs" data-widgetid="e1e72d47-3da3-4900-bdcd-6e03bc270ffd">

