        <p><strong>November 3 General Election&nbsp;</strong></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150228" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Snohomish County (Proposed Charter Amendments) Propositions 1-5 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150524" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">City of Bothell Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150601" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">City of Everett (Proposed Charter Amendments) Propositions 261-265 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150325" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Monroe School District No. 103 Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150596" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Mukilteo School District No. 6 Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150591" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Sultan School District No. 311 Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150585" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Fire Protection District No. 10 Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150581" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><s>Fire Protection District No. 15 Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</s></a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150435" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><s>Snohomish Regional Fire &amp; Rescue Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</s></a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150523" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">South Snohomish County Fire &amp; Rescue RFA Proposition No. 1 (PDF)</a></p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/150229" target="_blank" rel="noopener"