        <div id="Contact" style="background-color:#f5f5f7;
  border-top:2px solid #ccc;
  padding:1.5em 1em;
  margin-top:2em;"><h2 style="font-size:1.25em;
    margin-top:0;
    margin-bottom:0.5em;">Contact Us</h2><p style="margin-top:0;
    margin-bottom:1em;
    max-width:40em;">If you have questions or need assistance with voting or elections, we&rsquo;re here to help.</p><div style="display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:1.25em;"><div style="flex:1 1 260px;"><strong>Office Location</strong><br>3000 Rockefeller Avenue<br>Admin. West Building, First Floor<br>Everett, WA 98201</div><div style="flex:1 1 260px;"><strong>Email:&nbsp;</strong><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d1b4bdb4b2a5b8bebfa291a2bfbeb2beffb6bea7" style="color:#003366;"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="086d646d6b7c6167667b487b66676b67266f677e">[email&#160;protected]</span>&nbsp;</a><br><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:4253883444" style="color:#003366;">(425) 388-3444</a><br><strong>Fax:&nbsp;</strong>(425) 355-3444</div><div style="flex:1 1 260px;"><strong>Office Hours</strong><br>Monday through Friday<br>9 a.m. to 5 p.m.<br><br><p><strong>Please Note:</strong> hours may vary on holidays and during election periods.</p></div></div><p style="margin-top:1em;
    max-width:40em;"><a href="https://snohomishcountywa.gov/4150/Contact-Us" style="color:#003366;"><strong>View all contact info, including directions and parking information</strong></a></p><p style="margin-top:1em; max-width:40em;" data-pasted="true">For accessible service, call Washington Relay 1-800-833-6388 or 7-1-1 (TTY/TDD). Language assistance is available upon request.</p></div>
    </div>

